      "comment": "NEON LEON (4) settled close to the lead but collided in the run and turned spotting a start, finishing sixth (17.70) at this track over 297m in a Grade 4/5. Better than latest and worth another try. REINA (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (17.73) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Can figure in the finish. JUNK YARD JIGGLE (1) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when seventh (17.68) in a Grade 6 at Mandurah. Can feature with the right run. SHINBONER SMOKEY (2) is worth consideration.",
